  "name": "Question 1",
  "problem": "Consider the vector field $F$ and the surface $S$ with unit normal vector $n,$ where\n\n$$\nF(x,y,z)=⟨2z,\\,x+y,\\,y-z⟩\\,,\\,n(x,y,z)=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{3}}⟨1,\\,-1,\\,1⟩\\,.\n$$\n\nIf the flux of $F$ across $S$ with respect to $n$ is given by\n\n$$\n{∬}_{S}F\\cdot \\text{d}S=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{3}}{∬}_{S}\\boxed{}\\,\\text{d}S,\n$$\n\nwhat is the missing expression?",
